  "id": "body-image-ideals",
  "term": "body-image ideals",
  "definition": "Body-image ideals are the appearance or body-weight standards people feel they should meet, especially in settings where looks or weight are tied to performance. In this study context, these ideals are treated as influences on body-image perception, eating-related behaviors, and mental health.",
